{"3514440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Time For Pants", "steam_appid": 3514440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Neural Organic Replicant Model</strong>, or <strong>N.O.R.M.</strong> You wake in a mysterious facility and quickly realize you are not alone. The facility’s artificial intelligence has taken over - and the result is horrific.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on the successes of every run, looting everything you can extract with, unlocking new weapons, useful gear, and meaningful attachments as you delve deeper into the facility. You sense your humanity slipping away as you become the monster you need to be to escape… <i>if you were ever human at all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Runs</strong><br>Facility layouts, encounters, vent connections, and loot paths are randomized every run. No two attempts are the same, forcing constant adaptation and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong><br>Crawl through vents with a suppressed rifle or take enemies head-on with a fully automatic shotgun. You are the agent of emergent chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction-Based Risk Loop</strong><br>If you want to keep it, survive long enough to extract with it. If you want to build it later, turn it in to Terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Meta Progression</strong><br>Death is inevitable and progress is accumulative. Materials and implants persist across each life, making each N.O.R.M. more powerful than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Gear &amp; Loadout Decisions</strong><br>Weapons, attachments, and gear change how you play and the choices you make. Experiment with loadouts to survive with whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every death is a chance to learn.<br>Every life is a chance to evolve into something too powerful to contain.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>Neural Organic Replicant Model</strong>, or <strong>N.O.R.M.</strong> You wake in a mysterious facility and quickly realize you are not alone. The facility’s artificial intelligence has taken over - and the result is horrific.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/23461a774b36a9b8d6f3a4395c61f762.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on the successes of every run, looting everything you can extract with, unlocking new weapons, useful gear, and meaningful attachments as you delve deeper into the facility. You sense your humanity slipping away as you become the monster you need to be to escape… <i>if you were ever human at all.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Runs</strong><br>Facility layouts, encounters, vent connections, and loot paths are randomized every run. No two attempts are the same, forcing constant adaptation and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong><br>Crawl through vents with a suppressed rifle or take enemies head-on with a fully automatic shotgun. You are the agent of emergent chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/672f4476d1d77359e616007af4478755.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extraction-Based Risk Loop</strong><br>If you want to keep it, survive long enough to extract with it. If you want to build it later, turn it in to Terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Meta Progression</strong><br>Death is inevitable and progress is accumulative. Materials and implants persist across each life, making each N.O.R.M. more powerful than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.poster.avif?t=1767714302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.webm?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/extras/0c6f5e1be52ceed41aa29eac94237cc1.mp4?t=1767714302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Gear &amp; Loadout Decisions</strong><br>Weapons, attachments, and gear change how you play and the choices you make. Experiment with loadouts to survive with whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every death is a chance to learn.<br>Every life is a chance to evolve into something too powerful to contain.</p>", "short_description": "Fight for your loot with each extraction in a dark, dangerous facility that evolves as you push deeper. Customize loadouts and adapt your playstyle every run as you learn, loot, and unlock what you need to escape. Hardcore, compact, tactical, roguelite, extraction. This is No Time For Pants!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It’s unfair, brutal, and totally uncompromising, and that’s exactly what makes it great.”<br>Steam User nato187<br><br>“The first time I put on the sunglasses I smirked at how creative this Dev was. When I put my first sight on a gun I couldn't help but fall in love.”<br>Steam User whatisgod<br><br>“No Time For Pants stands out as a brilliantly designed roguelite that rewards precision, adaptability, and a twisted sense of humor. Its combination of tactical combat, procedural generation, and progression-through-failure design ensures hours of replayability.”<br>Vox Odyssey<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/92dc878155ab774973a7d2563e56d157f22bf3ef/header.jpg?t=1767714302", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/b878cb9a748285f500739863ce0a6bfb955cf47c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767714302", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/b878cb9a748285f500739863ce0a6bfb955cf47c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767714302", "website": "https://www.notimeforpants.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 2.77GHz Quad-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card with 4GB of RAM minimum, OpenGL 2.1 and GLSL `.1 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> FMOD compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<s